第二节 范文
Dear Jim,
Congratulations on winning the first place in the Chinese speech contest! I’m so happy to hear about your success.
I remember how challenging it was for you in the beginning, struggling with pronunciation, especially four tones.
But you never gave up, and put your heart and soul into practising. Now your hard work totally paid off. Your speech
was amazing! It showed not just your language skills but also your passion for Chinese culture. You absolutely made
it!
Keep up the fantastic work. Look forward to hearing more about your future success.
Yours,
Li Hua
